#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:2
msgid "Main content detection"
msgstr "主要内容检测"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs detects the main content area of HTML pages to focus on the "
"documentation content itself, ignoring headers, footers, navigation, and "
"other page elements."
msgstr "Read the Docs 会检测 HTML 页面的主要内容区域，聚焦于文档内容本身，忽略页眉、页脚、导航等页面元素。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:9
msgid "Feature usage"
msgstr "功能使用情况"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:11
msgid "Different features use this detection in different ways:"
msgstr "不同功能以不同方式使用该检测："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:13
msgid ""
":doc:`/visual-diff`: Uses a documentation-tool specific heuristic first. If "
"you configure a custom selector it overrides that heuristic."
msgstr ":doc:`/visual-diff` ：优先使用针对文档工具的启发式方法。若你配置了自定义选择器，则覆盖该启发式方法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:14
msgid ""
":doc:`/link-previews`: Uses the custom selector (if set) to scope links; "
"otherwise falls back to heuristics here."
msgstr ":doc:`/link-previews` ：使用自定义选择器（若已设置）限定链接范围；否则回退到此处的启发式方法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:15
msgid ""
":doc:`/server-side-search/index`: Always uses heuristics; it ignores any "
"configured custom selector."
msgstr ":doc:`/server-side-search/index` ：始终使用启发式方法，忽略任何已配置的自定义选择器。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:18
msgid "Detection logic"
msgstr "检测逻辑"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:20
msgid ""
"The main content node is detected using the following logic, in order of "
"priority:"
msgstr "主要内容节点按以下逻辑检测，优先级从高到低："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Elements with** ``role=\"main\"`` **attribute**: This ARIA role is used by"
" many static site generators and themes to indicate the main content area."
msgstr "**带** ``role=\"main\"`` ** 属性的元素** ：许多静态站点生成器和主题使用此 ARIA 角色来标示主要内容区域。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:23
msgid "**The** ``<main>`` **HTML tag**: The semantic HTML5 element for main content."
msgstr "**``<main>`` HTML 标签** ：HTML5 中表示主要内容的语义化元素。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Parent of the first** ``<h1>`` **tag**: If no explicit main content "
"markers are found, the system assumes all sections are siblings under a "
"common parent, and uses the parent of the first heading as the main content "
"container."
msgstr ""
"**第一个** ``<h1>`` ** 标签的父元素** "
"：若未找到明确的主要内容标记，系统假定所有章节是共同父元素下的同级节点，并使用首个标题的父元素作为主要内容容器。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:25
msgid ""
"**The** ``<body>`` **tag**: As a last resort, if none of the above are "
"found, the entire body is used."
msgstr "**``<body>`` 标签** ：作为最后手段，若以上都未找到，则使用整个 body。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:29
msgid ""
"Following the ARIA_ conventions will also improve the accessibility of your "
"site. See also https://webaim.org/techniques/semanticstructure/."
msgstr "遵循 ARIA_ 约定也能提升站点的可访问性。另见 https://webaim.org/techniques/semanticstructure/。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:35
msgid "Improving detection"
msgstr "改进检测"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:37
msgid ""
"If your documentation uses a non-standard structure, Read the Docs may not "
"correctly identify the main content area."
msgstr "若你的文档使用非标准结构，Read the Docs 可能无法正确识别主要内容区域。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:40
msgid "To improve detection, consider:"
msgstr "要改进检测，可考虑："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:42
msgid "Adding a ``role=\"main\"`` attribute to your main content container"
msgstr "为主要内容容器添加 ``role=\"main\"`` 属性"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:43
msgid "Using a ``<main>`` HTML tag in your theme"
msgstr "在主题中使用 ``<main>`` HTML 标签"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:44
msgid "Ensuring your main content has at least one ``<h1>`` heading"
msgstr "确保主要内容至少包含一个 ``<h1>`` 标题"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:47
msgid "Configuring a custom selector"
msgstr "配置自定义选择器"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:49
msgid ""
"If the automatic detection does not work for your project, you can "
"explicitly set the CSS selector for the main content node in your project "
"settings:"
msgstr "若自动检测对你的项目无效，可在项目设置中显式指定主要内容节点的 CSS 选择器："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:51
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Advanced`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Advanced` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:52
msgid ""
"Fill in the :guilabel:`CSS main content selector` field (for example: "
"``div#main`` or ``.my-content``). Leave it blank to use automatic detection."
msgstr ""
"填写 :guilabel:`CSS main content selector` 字段（例如 ``div#main`` 或 ``.my-"
"content`` ）。留空则使用自动检测。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:53
msgid "Save the settings."
msgstr "保存设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:55
msgid ""
"When this selector is configured, it overrides the heuristic detection only "
"for addons that honor it (currently Visual Diff and Link Previews). Choose a"
" stable container whose structure does not change between builds to avoid "
"spurious diffs or missed link previews. It will not affect search indexing "
"unless we add support in the future."
msgstr ""
"配置该选择器后，仅对遵循它的 addon 覆盖启发式检测（目前是 Visual Diff 和 Link "
"Previews）。请选择结构在多次构建间保持稳定的容器，避免虚假差异或遗漏的链接预览。除非未来增加支持，它不会影响搜索索引。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:57
msgid "Examples of good selectors:"
msgstr "良好选择器示例："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:59
msgid "``div#content`` (an id that wraps all page content)"
msgstr "``div#content`` （包裹全部页面内容的 id）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:60
msgid "``div[role=\"main\"]`` (ARIA role usage)"
msgstr "``div[role=\"main\"]`` （ARIA 角色用法）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:64
msgid ""
"Avoid overly broad selectors like ``body`` or ones matching multiple nodes "
"(e.g. a class applied to multiple elements)."
msgstr "避免使用过于宽泛的选择器，如 ``body`` ，或匹配多个节点的选择器（例如应用于多个元素的类）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:67
msgid "Example structures"
msgstr "结构示例"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:70
msgid "Using role=\"main\" or <main> tag"
msgstr "使用 role=\"main\" 或 <main> 标签"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:95
msgid "Inferring from first h1 tag"
msgstr "从首个 h1 标签推断"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:97
msgid ""
"If a main node isn't found, we try to infer the main node from the parent of"
" the first section with a ``h1`` tag. Example:"
msgstr "若未找到 main 节点，我们会尝试从第一个带 ``h1`` 标签的章节的父元素推断 main 节点。示例："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:128
msgid "Fallback to body tag"
msgstr "回退到 body 标签"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/main-content-detection.rst:130
msgid "If a section title isn't found, we default to the ``body`` tag. Example:"
msgstr "若未找到章节标题，默认使用 ``body`` 标签。示例："

